description.en:
This anthology is packed with seven wonderful stories about naughty episodes between young boys and their "older sisters" from the super healthy boys' comic magazine Monthly Shonen Champion!! All sorts of things with our slightly naughty "older sisters"...we just love our "older sisters"!!! Included works: Mantsuman by Minamoto Yuu; Bathhouse Reception Paradise by Sogabe Toshinori; Cigarettes with Older Sister by Akegata Iruka; My Older Sister Will Teach You by Chiaki Taro; I'm Your Body Pillow by Hori Hiroaki; Kasumi-neechan Don't Be Dependent!! by Haseyoshi Eria; Stray Boy by Itosugi Masahiro;

